      },
      "note": [
        "The table contains data on the area and number of public green areas within the urban boundary of localities with at least 30 000 inhabitants and Visby locality. A public green area is defined as an area of contiguous green space of at least 0.5 hectares which is available for the public. In the table, public green areas are grouped by size 0.5-3 hectares, 5-10 hectares and 10 hectares and larger. Smallest mapping unit is 0.5 hectares."
